2. The CET-C2s colour map (src/cet_c2s.txt)

The 256 rows of the colour map colorcet.cm.CET_C2s from colorcet 3.1.0
(https://github.com/holoviz/colorcet), unchanged. Colour map by Peter Kovesi,
"Good Colour Maps: How to Design Them", arXiv:1509.03700. colorcet is licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

3. The public fixtures (tests/fixtures/bg2050 and tests/fixtures/biodiversity)

Derived from two public conversations in https://github.com/compdemocracy/openData,
bg2050-volunteers and scoop-hivemind.biodiversity, licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Data was gathered using the
Polis software (see: compdemocracy.org/polis and github.com/compdemocracy/polis)
