Democracy Project.

Changes made: the comments that were moderated in (3,948 of 7,400 and 154 of
316) were run through the Delphi pipeline (embeddings all-MiniLM-L6-v2, UMAP,
EVoC clustering, topic names written by the language model qwen2.5:1.5b).
proximity.json holds each comment's id, UMAP position and cluster at each
layer; topics.json holds the topic names; expected.json holds what datamapplot
computed from them (notice 1) and the CET-C2s rows as colorcet gives them
(notice 2). No comment text and no vote is in these files.
